# ======================================================================
# StepCalc Error Handling Demonstration (.calc)
# Demonstrates diagnostic formatting, caret pointers (^^^), and hints
# ======================================================================

# 1. Consecutive Operators (Format / Syntax Error)
10 + * 5

# 2. Unclosed Parenthesis (Format / Syntax Error)
(20 + 30 * 2

# 3. Unmatched Closing Parenthesis (Syntax Error)
50 + 20)

# 4. Illegal Character (Lexical Error)
100 $ 20

# 5. Division by Zero (Runtime Evaluation Error)
50 / 0

# 6. Modulo by Zero (Runtime Evaluation Error)
50 % 0

# 7. Negative Exponent (Domain Error: Integer Language)
2 ^ -3

# 8. Undefined Variable Lookup (Runtime Semantic Error)
total_score + 10
